<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Portal - Password Reset Security Notification</title>
    <style>
        {{CSS_CONTENT}}
    </style>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f1f5f9; margin: 0; padding: 30px 15px; color: #334155;">

    <div class="email-card" style="max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 44, 89, 0.1); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <div class="email-header" style="background-color: #0F2C59; background: #0F2C59; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F2C59 0%, #1E3A8A 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 28px 30px; text-align: center;">
            <div class="system-notice" style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: #38bdf8; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 6px;">Security Dispatch: Official Password Reset Notice</div>
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"> {{INSTITUTION_NAME}} </h1>
            <p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0; opacity: 0.85;">Campus Services Portal - Information Security & Identity Office</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-body" style="padding: 32px 30px; line-height: 1.6;">
            <div class="body-title-row" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #0f2c59; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800;">Account Password Reset Request</h2>
                {{STATUS_BADGE}}
            </div>

            <p class="greeting-text" style="font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0;">Dear <strong>{{FULL_NAME}}</strong>,</p>

            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6;">A password reset request has been initiated for your Campus Services Portal account. If you or an authorized university administrator requested this change, you may set a new password by clicking the secure button below:</p>

            <table class="meta-table" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 13px;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; width: 140px;">User Category:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value-primary" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: 700; color: #0f2c59;">{{USER_CATEGORY}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; width: 140px;">Account Identifier:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value-primary" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: 700; color: #0f2c59;">{{INDEX_NUMBER}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; width: 140px;">Account Email:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value-secondary" style="padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">{{REGISTERED_EMAIL}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label" style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; width: 140px;">Faculty / Unit:</td>
                    <td style="padding: 10px 14px; color: #334155;">{{FACULTY_NAME}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="action-btn-container" style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 24px 0;">
                <!-- Email-client bulletproof table button with solid fallback -->
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#2563eb" style="border-radius: 8px; background-color: #2563eb;">
                            <a href="{{RESET_URL}}" class="action-btn" target="_blank" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2563eb; background: #2563eb; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%); color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #1d4ed8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;">
                                <span style="color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">Reset Your Portal Password</span>
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="token-box" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
                <div class="token-title" style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 700;">Direct Reset Token / Key</div>
                <div class="token-code" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f2c59; word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace;">{{TOKEN}}</div>
            </div>

            <p class="expiry-text" style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 24px;">🔒 This secure reset link and token are valid until: <strong>{{EXPIRES_STR}}</strong> (24 Hours).</p>

            <div class="signoff-block" style="font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Yours faithfully,</p>
                <p class="signoff-signature" style="font-weight: 700; color: #0f2c59; margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 24px;">Identity & Access Management Administrator</p>
            </div>

            <hr class="divider" style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
            <p class="disclaimer-text" style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; margin: 0;"><strong>Security Advisory:</strong> If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or report immediately to the University IT Helpdesk. Your existing password will remain active until a new one is confirmed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-footer" style="background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
            <p class="footer-title" style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Campus Services Portal - University Security & Identity Office</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">This is an automated system dispatch. Please do not reply directly to this email address.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
